  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>A grateful underworld dragon has rewarded you with a shred of its power.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Any non-good alignment, you must have performed a service for a mythic underworld dragon. Benefit: Once per day, you can treat a melee weapon or unarmed strike as if it were adamantine for the purposes of overcoming damage reduction or bypassing hardness. This effect lasts until your next turn.</p>\n<p><strong>Mythic:</strong> You choose a single opponent when activating this feat instead. Against that opponent, all melee weapon and unarmed strikes that you make are considered to be adamantine for the purposes of overcoming damage reduction or bypassing hardness for the remainder of the encounter, or until 1 minute has passed. You can expend one use of mythic power to extend the duration of this feat to a full 24 hours.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/additional-non-mythic-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
